; Index = (Y0>>4)<<4 | (Y1>>4). Each record contains pair positions
; 7/6, 5/4, 3/2, 1/0. Longword bytes are P0:P1:P2:P3.
; Interleaving keeps all 68000 indexed displacements in d8 range.
; --------------------------------------------------------------------
